flowchart TD
  A[question + history] --> B[planner.next_action]
  B -->|final| Z[return answer]
  B -->|invalid reply| R{2 in a row?}
  R -- no --> A
  R -- yes --> Z
  B -->|tool + args| C[call_tool]
  C -->|result or error| D[append to history]
  D --> E{steps < max?}
  E -- yes --> A
  E -- no --> Z
